{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15262","headline":"古别离二首 二 · 李端","name":"古别离二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君桂阳别，令君岳阳待。\n後事忽差池，前期日空在。\n木落雁嗷嗷，洞庭波浪高。\n远山云似盖，极浦树如毫。\n朝发能几里，暮来风又起。\n如何两处愁，皆在孤舟里。\n昨夜天月明，长川寒且清。\n菊花开欲尽，荠菜泊来生。\n下江帆势速，五两遥相逐。\n欲问去时人，知投何处宿。\n空令猿啸时泣对湘簟竹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}